    <section class="about">
      <h2>Made for<br>the lore.</h2>
      <div>
        <p>WastedToken Mint turns digital folklore into things with weight. Every coin is designed in-house, pressure-struck in small runs, and finished by hand until it catches light like a secret worth keeping.</p>
        <p>No utility. No roadmap. Just exquisite metal evidence that you were part of something strange, specific, and briefly unforgettable.</p>
